<h2>Why buy in Kisaasi</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Titled land — clean property rights</li>
  <li>Newer constructions (2015+)</li>
  <li>Close to Kisaasi Roundabout, Ntinda, and Kyanja</li>
  <li>Good for first-time buyers and diaspora investors</li>
</ul>

<h2>Typical prices in 2026</h2>
<ul>
  <li>3 bedroom bungalow on 50x100 ft: <strong>180,000,000 – 350,000,000 UGX</strong></li>
  <li>4 bedroom bungalow on 50x100 ft: <strong>300,000,000 – 500,000,000 UGX</strong></li>
  <li>Land only (50x100 ft): <strong>60,000,000 – 120,000,000 UGX</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2>How to avoid property scams in Kisaasi</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Never transfer money before signing.</strong> No exceptions.</li>
  <li><strong>Hire your own lawyer</strong> — not the seller's.</li>
  <li><strong>Verify the title</strong> at the Ministry of Lands, Entebbe Road.</li>
  <li><strong>Prefer Verified listings</strong> — these have been reviewed by our team.</li>
</ol>

